  {
   "copper": 800,
   "description": "Jungle Ape Last-Offering receives visitors in the Stormscale Thunderwood northeast from here, and the survivors describe an appalling welcome. Take a full group by boat to Stormscale Summit and defeat that elite ape. For once, the crown is prepared to reward a complete failure of diplomacy.",
   "giver": "r20_human_capital_envoy",
   "giver_name": "Mariel Waybook",
