   "title": "Group: An Audience Nobody Requested",
   "turnin": "r20_human_capital_envoy",
   "xp": 0
  },
  {
   "copper": 600,
   "description": "The court tailors have discovered Silver Ape Hair, and their enthusiasm survives every description of the journey. Take a boat to Stormscale Summit and collect four tufts from Glass-Knuckle Jungle Apes in the Stormscale Thunderwood by day. Bring them to me for payment; I handle the purse so you needn't hear about hems. This bounty is available again one hour after each turn-in.",
